<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Lola’s HOME — the destination | BTCisGTO</title><meta name="description" content="The long-term vision for Lola’s HOME: an eco-resort, organic farm, and community space in the Philippines."><link rel="canonical" href="https://btcisgto.cloud/goal/"><meta property="og:title" content="Lola’s HOME — the destination | BTCisGTO"><meta property="og:description" content="The long-term vision for Lola’s HOME: an eco-resort, organic farm, and community space in the Philippines."><meta property="og:type" content="website"><meta property="og:url" content="https://btcisgto.cloud/goal/"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/mission-v1.css"><script src="/assets/mission-v1.js" defer></script></head><body><a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a><header class="site-header"><div class="shell header-inner"><a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="BTCisGTO home"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">₿</span>BTC<span>is</span>GTO</a><button class="menu-button" aria-controls="main-nav" aria-expanded="false">Menu</button><nav class="nav" id="main-nav" aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="/tools/" >Tools</a><a href="/goal/" aria-current="page">The mission</a><a href="/treasury/" >Treasury</a><a href="/building/" >Build log</a><a href="/learn/" >Learn</a></nav><a class="btn primary header-cta" href="/tradingtool/">Start practicing ↗</a></div></header><main id="main"><div class="shell"><div class="page-head"><div class="eyebrow">Lola’s HOME · the long-term destination</div><h1>A place to rest.<br>To grow.<br><em>To belong.</em></h1><p>Lola’s HOME means Heaven on Metaphysical Earth. It is Jay’s vision for an eco-resort and farm in the Philippines, with care for people and the land at its center.</p></div></div><div class="shell"><section class="home-band" style="padding:30px;margin-bottom:45px"><div class="eyebrow">A vision in development</div><h2>Useful work.<br>Patient capital.<br>A real home.</h2><p style="margin:20px 0 0">This is a proposed destination. The website does not establish acquired land, an operating resort, construction progress, or a funded project budget.</p></section><div class="columns"><article><h3>Food & land</h3><p>Organic farming, locally grown food, and educational gardens—including the medicinal plants central to the original HOME vision.</p></article><article><h3>Rest & community</h3><p>A welcoming retreat for families, builders, artists, and people seeking time to reconnect.</p></article><article><h3>Resilient infrastructure</h3><p>Explore solar energy, water collection, and thoughtful design as plans and site conditions become concrete.</p></article></div><article class="prose"><h2>Compassion is the reason.</h2><p>Jay’s story began in Angeles City and became a mission to turn personal growth into service. Bitcoin is part of the financial strategy; tools and public learning are part of the work. A place that supports people is the purpose.</p><blockquote>“Stack sats until you can build heaven. Then build it and open the gates.”</blockquote><h2>The path to a physical place</h2><ol><li>Build products people find useful and establish sustainable operating revenue.</li><li>Publish treasury reporting and a clear allocation policy.</li><li>Define location criteria, land requirements, budgets, and feasible phases.</li><li>Publish evidence of land acquisition and approved plans before claiming construction progress.</li></ol><p>No opening date, return on contribution, or medical treatment outcome is promised.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn primary" href="/building/">Follow the build <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="btn " href="/treasury/">Review the treasury <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></article></div></main><footer class="site-footer"><div class="shell"><div class="footer-top"><div><a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="BTCisGTO home"><span class="brand-mark